cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "IsoGrow: local bioisostere search and molecular growth pipeline"
abstract: >-
  An open reimplementation of the SwissBioisostere fragment-replacement idea on
  top of matched molecular pairs mined from ChEMBL, combined with an end-to-end
  pipeline from fragment replacement to CReM variants, 3D alignment, docking and
  ranking.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-28
license: MIT
authors:
